msgid "Windowsでの接続"
msgstr ""

#. list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/set-up-a-vpn-server-on-openwrt-using-openvpn/index.md:597
msgid "**OpenVPN GUIをインストール**"
msgstr ""

#. list item > list item > paragraph
#: content/ja/blog/set-up-a-vpn-server-on-openwrt-using-openvpn/index.md:598
msgid ""
"[OpenVPN公式ダウンロードページ](https://openvpn.net/download-open-vpn/)から"
